  "instrument": "TMA1995",
  "kind": "section",
  "number": "136E",
  "ref": "TMA1995/s136E",
  "text": "Seized goods are forfeited to the Commonwealth if: (a) the goods are released by the ComptrollerGeneral of Customs to the designated owner; and (b) the designated owner does not take possession of the goods within 90 days of the release. Note: For designated owner and seized goods see section 6.",
